#: VirtualMailManager/catchall.py:67
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cannot add %(count_new)i new destination(s) to catch-all alias for\n"
"domain '%(domain)s'. Currently this alias expands into %(count)i/%(limit)i\n"
"recipients. %(count_new)i additional destination(s) will render this alias\n"
"unusable.\n"
"Hint: Increase Postfix' virtual_alias_expansion_limit"
msgstr ""
"Det går inte att lägga till %(count_new)i nya destinationer till uppsamlingsaliaset för\n"
"domänen ”%(domain)s”. För närvarande utökas aliaset till %(count)i/%(limit)i\n"
"mottagare. %(count_new)i ytterligare destinationer gör "
"aliaset\n"
"oanvändbart.\n"
"Tips: Öka Postfix virtual_alias_expansion_limit"

#: VirtualMailManager/catchall.py:75
#, python-format
